"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Warn If Signature Certificate Expires</h1>"
"\n"
"Select the minimum number of days the signature certificate should be valid without issuing a warning.\n"
"<p>\n"
"The recommended SPHINX setting is 14 days.\n"
"</p>"
"</qt>"
